t choose the correct movie from four options.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    }\n  ],\n  "techStack": {\n    "frontend": [\n      "React JS"\n    ],\n    "backend": [\n      "None"\n    ],\n    "language": [\n      "JavaScript (ES6+)"\n    ]\n  },\n  "colors": {\n    "primary": "#dffc03",\n    "secondary": "#fdf7f8",\n    "accent": "#0f3460"\n  },\n  "theme": "light",\n  "layoutDescription": "The first page is a login screen. After login, the main quiz page displays two columns side by side: Hollywood on the left and Kollywood on the right. Each column contains cards or sections for each quiz type (Mystery Movie Box, Speed Cast Match, Guess the Movie by Emoji, Find the Movie with Blurred Poster, Frame Freeze Quiz). Users can select and play any quiz from either column. The UI is vibrant, with clear separation between the two columns and visually engaging quiz cards."\n}'}",
